    "modid": "voidlessclient",
    "modName": "VoidlessClient",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "# Voidless Client  A client-side utility client for **NeoForge 26.1.2** with a Future-style ClickGUI.  ## Opening the menu Press **Right Shift** in-game to open or close the ClickGUI. Drag panels by their header, left-click a module to toggle it, and right-click to open its settings. Your settings and panel positions are saved to `voidless_client.properties` in your game folder.  ## Modules  **Combat** - KillAura: target priority, smooth or instant rotation, FOV and range settings - CrystalAura: place and break with damage estimation and anti-suicide - AutoTotem: refills your offhand totem - AutoRegen: uses a regeneration potion when your health is low - Surround: places obsidian around your feet  **Movement** - ElytraFly: Control and Boost modes - Speed, Sprint, Step  **Render** - XRay: ore highlighting with per-ore toggles - ESP: boxes, glow, names, health and distance - BaseFinder: finds clusters of player-made containers - Fullbright  **World** - FastPlace, FastBreak  ## HUD Watermark, animated arraylist, toggle notifications and four colour themes.  ## Requirements - Minecraft 26.1.2 - NeoForge - Client-side only. Do not install it on a server.  ## Disclaimer Many servers prohibit mods like this and their anti-cheat may detect it. You are responsible for how you use it. Only use it on singleplayer, your own server, or servers that allow it.",
    "author": "x8hmx",
    "websiteURL": "https://modrinth.com/mod/voidless-client",
    "license": "GNU General Public License version 3 (GPLv3)",
    "serverSideOnly": false,
